@startuml
' NewEra POS - Design sequence diagram: UC3 Process Rental, total of the rental (Contract 15) and cancel, W11 draft
' Team D - editable source of assets/dsd_uc3_end_rental.png
' Render with: java -jar plantuml.jar -charset UTF-8 -tpng assets/dsd_uc3_end_rental.puml
' Participants: classes of the logical view (architecture.md 4.2) and of the design class diagram skeleton. Operations: system_interfaces.md 3.4, 4.1 and 4.3.
' Messages marked <<new>> are not in the logical view or in system_interfaces.md yet (sent to Borja for the design class diagram). Review #66: findings 4 and 5.

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #444444
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF1FB
skinparam BoxPadding 6
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F4F8FD
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam SequenceDividerBackgroundColor #EAF1FB
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B8A04A
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam LegendBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 190

title NewEra POS - Design sequence diagram: UC3 Process Rental, total and cancel (Contract 15, ext. 10-13a)

box "UI layer (ui.api)" #F4F8FD
  participant ":Rental\nController" as Ctl
end box
box "Application / domain layer" #F4F8FD
  participant ":Rental\nHandler" as H
  participant "rental:\nRental" as R
  participant ":Payment\nMethods" as PMs
  participant "pm:\nPaymentMethod" as PM
end box
box "application.interfaces" #F4F8FD
  participant ":StoreDatabase\nSync" as Sync
  participant ":TaxCalculator" as Tax
  participant ":Settings\nRepository" as Set
end box

== endRental() - Contract 15 ==
[-> Ctl : POST /api/rentals/{rentalID}/end
Ctl -> H : endRental()
H -> R : taxLines() <<new>>
note right of R
  The rental fee of each line, without the deposit:
  the deposit is not taxed (BR-10, decided in W09).
  Every line must have a period (precondition).
end note
R --> H : lines (item ID, rental fee)
H -> Tax : calculateTax(TaxRequest: rental fee lines)
note right of Tax
  Timeout 5 s in the adapter (IR-05, AD-07)
end note
Tax --> H : TaxResult
alt TaxResult OK
  H -> R : setTax(taxPerLine)
else NOT_AVAILABLE (11a)
  H -> Set : current()
  Set --> H : settings (default tax rate)
  H -> R : applyDefaultTaxRate(rate) <<new>>
  note right of R
    The Rental calculates the tax of its rental fees
    and sets taxToBeCorrected = true (BR-02), as the
    Sale in UC1 (dsd_uc1_endSale). The screen shows
    a short warning (NFR-15).
  end note
end
H -> R : complete()
R -> R : isComplete = true\ntotal = rental fee + tax + deposit
R --> H : rental fee, tax, deposit, total, due date
H --> Ctl : totals
[<-- Ctl : 200 rental fee, tax, deposit (not taxed),\ntotal, due date, taxToBeCorrected

== cancelRental() - ext. 10-13a (no contract) ==
[-> Ctl : DELETE /api/rentals/{rentalID}
Ctl -> H : cancelRental()
opt a card payment was sent and its outcome is unknown (NOT_AVAILABLE, 13b2b)
  H -> PMs : get(CREDIT_CARD)
  PMs --> H : pm
  H -> PM : giveUp(rental)
  note right of PM
    voidAuthorization with the same rental ID
    (IR-15, AD-07), as cancelSale in UC1.
  end note
end
loop each line of the rental
  H -> Sync : removeHold(serialNumber, rentalID)
  note right of Sync
    Queued in store_sync_list when the
    store database is not available (AD-05).
  end note
end
H -> H : discard the rental (never saved;\nthe item status does not change, FR-36)
H --> Ctl : cancelled
[<-- Ctl : 200 rental cancelled, item status unchanged

legend bottom left
  **GRASP**
  Controller: RentalController and RentalHandler, as in the start of the rental.
  Information Expert: Rental knows its lines, calculates the default tax of its rental fees (applyDefaultTaxRate, as Sale in UC1)
  and its total (fee + tax + deposit, Contract 15).
  Polymorphism: cancelRental voids an unknown card payment through PaymentMethod.giveUp (AD-08, IR-15).
  Protected Variations, Indirection: TaxCalculator and StoreDatabaseSync are interfaces; the adapter applies the timeout
  and the handler chooses the fallback (default tax rate from SettingsRepository) (AD-04, AD-07).
endlegend
@enduml
